Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.78,0:01:55.45,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(851,1025)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Hundred-Million Man
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Joker, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They aren't normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his fault! Who's?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The south bird is him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's controlling the bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can control bugs and guide ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something but it sure\Ndoesn't sound like any
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:03:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bird to me up there what\Nare they boulders yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like an avalanche no you're\Nwrong they're bugs ladybugs big ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no end to them! They just keep\Npopping up. Stupid crickets. Oh come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on you think you can Beat me do you\Ni wish those birds were as easy to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see as they are to hear a slug that\Nsize needs A lot of salt how could you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think of cooking at a time like this\Ni'm not salt dissolved slugs idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of all this running!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stand and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! No, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's still in our history!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fireflies! Pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.15,0:03:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.77,0:04:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll say! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fine piece of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You punks have no right to take that gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what gives us the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're way stronger than\Nyou and your pals, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say that alone gives us the right\Nto take what we want, when we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'm cutting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amok Satori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Palsy, Sargus, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish him off my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with those\Nspring-spring fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoujo, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Shoujou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what he found! Gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bell-shaped ingot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's just like it\Nsays here in the logbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.59,0:05:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold bells, the story's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:05:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Load up, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for you, old man, grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.37,0:06:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This city of gold is just a fairy\Ntale that Lionel and dreamt it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be a pirate in this\Nnew era, you've got to wise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your dreams will never come true, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of gold does exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My house is pretty small.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know something junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A worthless little punk like you who\Nis too afraid to believe in dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't have the right\Nto call himself a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like trying to find\Na needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't even see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we could never get close enough to\Ngrab it thanks to all those stupid bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we did was run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So seven people couldn't catch one bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, won't you get it together, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been doing this for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just said, you morons\Nthink you can catch us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morons?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, birdbrain, I'll give you a\Ngood one right between your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can grab it if I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops, we caught one of those birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pops, what happened? Masira!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a better question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.75,0:08:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Going Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I find out they're going to be\Nsorry they ever laid a finger on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the savages! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid. You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to move, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did everything we could to\Nstop them, but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just looked pretty pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta get moving, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's not going to patch itself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Pops! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what happened first!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.87,0:08:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter anymore.\NDid you have any luck finding a?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that you got\Nyourself a south bird nice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:09:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,job they're hard to catch\Nluffy crickets gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff it's junk\Njust forget it it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter your dream is more\Nimportant we have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get you to the night\Nforget it how can you say
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that think about what it\Ntook to get that gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10 years of diving to\Nthe bottom of the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,subjecting your body to\Nall the pressures of!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deep come on you can't\Njust shut up i'm serious
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that gold and what happens\Nto it is our problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it. Your ship's in\Nno shape to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the knock-up stream\Nif we can get all the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoyama Alliance crew here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll have it fixed\Nand reinforced by morning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll still be able to set sail tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.19,0:09:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will send you to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise that old timer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Bellamy's mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want any help? I'll\Nhandle this one alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,luffy don't be stupid\Nwe don't have time for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this we have to set sail in three hours if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i follow the coast will\Nthat take me all the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way back to Mock Town\Nyes i believe it will
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey where are you going
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't be an idiot You
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't possibly take on\Nthis Bellamy guy all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By yourself if you want\Nto stop him, use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid don't do it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back by morning, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow looks like the old moons\Nright up there under the water
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess my eyesight's really getting bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get my eyes checked or I'm\Ngonna end up falling off this dock
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine that, a pirate\Nwith bad eyesight. Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather lose one\Neye than have two bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Least I'd get an eye patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fancy one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you know? A newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the really early edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't no paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.23,0:11:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a stack of wanted posters. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this town coming\Nto when no life's come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number of fine upstanding\Ncitizens like myself huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's those spineless guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this afternoon ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Lead kid talking about the\Nisland in the sky was a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he worth 30 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my eyes that really\Nis getting pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So one ten one hundred one thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:12:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ten thousand one hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna need\Nsome reading glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 thousand? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One million.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three hours Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you take any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna lose our\Nchance to go to Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's gonna be all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's been diving\Ndangerously like this for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming up too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not giving the gas bubbles\Nenough time to fully dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is following what\NI believe to be my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a battle between me and Nolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:13:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did what we could to stop\Nthem, but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those apes really cracked me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was hilarious when they\Nwere all bloody and had tears
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and snot running down their\Nfaces and started crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really meant so much, they should\Nhave done a better job of protecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those guys were so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing would have happened\Nto anyone else as stupid as them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking on a big-time pirate worth\N55 million berries like Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones that were here\Nthis afternoon, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.51,0:13:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, you've got to get\Nout of here this instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm serious, you're in terrible danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,60?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two together are worth $160 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bounties are higher than your spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were laughing at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we messed with the wrong people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think they remember what we look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of anyone having\Na bounty worth 100 million before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.11,0:15:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes to scare you big tough\Nguys are some little scraps of paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, do you all have\Nempty sockets for eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw their scrawny little leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing but a sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I'll explain it to you morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are pirates like\Nthese losers who fake their
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own wanted posters just to\Nmake a name for themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fakers win fights without\Nthrowing a single punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.19,0:15:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their enemies take one look at their\Nbogus bounties, turn tail and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you sorry excuses for\Npirates are doing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw them. They're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't even fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now you're all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, they almost pulled\None over on us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.82,0:15:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone with a bounty of 100 million would
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.45,0:15:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have had to pull off\Nsome pretty big capers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looked pretty young, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that kid's so wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how come we've never seen his\Npicture in the papers before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:16:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of any kid\Nin a Straw Hat, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was pretty scared\Nthere for a moment, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, speak of the devil, we\Nwere just talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got something you\Nwant to say to me, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give back Pop's gold,\Nevery bit of it, right now.

